b'SYDNEY: Australia coach Justin Langer admitted on Monday that there is a dearth of batting talent in the country as not enough talented batsmen are coming through the ranks. 


Australia have added leg-spinning all-rounder Marnus Labuschagne to the 13-member squad shortly after losing the third Test at the MCG on Sunday, but Langer is still unsure about the shape of the playing XI for the fourth Test that begins on Thursday.


