2. Gardenscapes

Gardenscapes is all about restoring a garden to its former glory. This is an adventurous journey of restoring and decorating different areas of the garden. There are some in-game characters which include Austin, butler and a dog.


3. Game of Thrones: Conquest

Warner Bros. International Enterprises recently launched the mobile game of one of the most famous TV series-- Game of Thrones. The Conquest is a strategy game in which a player has to power up your best dragon and claim The Iron Throne. The game is based on the similar concept of the TV show and it offers 120+ iconic Seats of Power like Winterfell, Castle Black, and King\xe2\x80\x99s Landing to conquer.


4. Command & Conquer: Rivals PVP

Command & Conquer: Rivals PVP is a 1v1 real-time multiplayer game. In this game, players will have to create an army and win the battle. The game also allows players to customize their army with a unique commander, infantry units and vehicles.


5. Idle Heros - Idle Games

Idle Heros is a RPG game where players have to form their heroes and guide them to win every battle. The game has tons of content and there are more than 200 heroes with a different set of skills and power. Players can also set their heroes for training to improve their strength and skills. 


6. Empire & Puzzle: RPG Quest

Empire & Puzzle: RPG Quest is a role-playing puzzle game based on PvP game mode. It offers an online multiplayer mode that allows players to compete against other players from the world. 


7. Harry Potter: Hogwarts Mystery
The game is based on the famous series of fantasy novels by JK Rowling. According to the developer, this will give users a unique experience of the wizarding world at Hogwarts. The game also allows players to choose a story, learn magical spells and duel against rivals. 


8. Homescapes

Just like Gardenscapes, Homescapes game is based on the similar idea of decorating and renovating Austin's house. You will have to help Austin in which you have to bring that comfort and warmth back to his family by renovating the house in different styles.




