Hemant Bhargava, who took charge as MD last year, was instrumental in completing the design and setting up of a separate micro insurance vertical, which was LIC\xe2\x80\x99s first comprehensive enterprise-wide initiative in the financial inclusion space. He also set up a new joint venture in collaboration with the banking industry and founded LIC Cards Services, launching \xe2\x80\x9cLIC Card\xe2\x80\x9d in 2009.

