b'MUMBAI: Two brokers\xe2\x80\x99 bodies have together decided to respond to Sebi and Mumbai police\xe2\x80\x99s notices and chargesheets to about 300 brokers in the Rs 5,600-crore National Spot Exchange (NSEL) scam. 


