b'COIMBATORE: The value of announced mergers & acquisitions (M&A) deals involving Indian companies reached $129.4 billion in 2018, a 104.7% increase in value from the previous year, surpassing the annual record of $67.4 billion set in 2007. 


The number of announced deals also grew 17.2% year-on-year (y-o-y) and witnessed the busiest annual period since records began in 1980.


