b'Chennai: The dismal festival season sales this year will chew away 70 bsp (basis points) (100 bsp = 1%) to 140 bsp on the margins of automotive companies. The third quarter of the current fiscal witnessed the lowest festival sales in nearly 5 years both for motorcycles and scooters as well as passenger vehicles.

