b'Cuaron\xe2\x80\x99s film is set in Mexico, but we can all relate to the emotionally charged relationship with domestic workers
Roma, the beautiful autobiographical film by Mexican director Alfonso Cuaron, is not only a festival sensation, it is a landmark for its producer Netflix. Set in the 1970s, it is a delicate homage to Cuaron\xe2\x80\x99s \xe2\x80\x9csecond mother\xe2\x80\x9d, a domestic worker at his childhood home, here depicted as Cleo.



