b'Women make up half the world, and they must be equally in charge of it. Tara Krishnaswamy, civic activist and convenor of an initiative to bring more women into electoral politics, spoke to Amulya Gopalakrishnan about her work:


What is your project about, and why is a women\xe2\x80\x99s caucus needed in our politics?


                    (function(){
                      var adContainer = '<div id="div-gpt-ad-1485328452682222244" data-size="fluid" data-adsslot="TOI/TOI_ROS/TOI_ROS_AS/TOI_ROS_AS_Mrec_MID_300" class="webonly alC"></div>';
