b'KOLKATA/MUMBAI: Bandhan Bank and HDFC-controlled Gruh Finance, an affordable home loans subsidiary, are set to unveil a $12-billion share-swap merger. A formal announcement could come this week\xe2\x80\x94as early as Monday evening or Tuesday. Investment bankers were roped in to formalize the deal-making negotiated directly between the dominant shareholders of the two entities.


