b'NEW DELHI: In a setback to Anil Ambani\xe2\x80\x99s embattled Reliance Communications (RCom) and its Rs 15,000-crore spectrum and mobile tower deal with elder brother Mukesh\xe2\x80\x99s telecom venture Reliance Jio, the government has refused to provide immunity to the latter from any pastpayment liabilities that may arise once the transaction is completed.


