b'By R Mahalakshmi
All of us have seen businesses evolve with time and changing macro-economic forces. Some businesses sustain and stay the same rock solid over the years. Some start well, but soon fail. Then there are those select few that grow from strength to strength. These become case studies for generations to come, agile to anticipate trends \xe2\x80\x94 they don\xe2\x80\x99t just sustain but thrive \xe2\x80\x94 adapting and growing, irrespective of changing consumer trends or economic forces.



