b'With the markets remaining volatile, net inflows into equity mutual funds (MFs) have slumped to the lowest level in more than two years in December. Net inflows into equity MF schemes (including arbitrage funds and ELSS or equity-linked savings schemes) stood at around Rs 4,400 crore in December 2018, the lowest since September 2016, data with the Association of Mutual Funds in India (AMFI) showed.The benchmark Sensex and the broad-based Nifty remained largely remained flat during December. 

