b'Chennai: A combination of aggressive network expansion by car companies and sharp sales slowdown particularly in top five metro markets is causing dealer stress in Motown. 

According to auto financiers, bankers and dealers, even companies with best-selling models are facing dealer attrition \xe2\x80\x94 partly on account of unsound financial practices by the dealers themselves and partly due to too many players biting into the same pie. 



