b'NEW DELHI: A big-hitter on the field and a hit 'entertainer' off it, former West Indies all-rounder Dwayne Bravo entertained fans for more than a decade before calling time on his 14 year international career in October last year. 


However, Bravo will be available for Twenty20 franchise events all over the world, which means his iconic \xe2\x80\x98champion dance\xe2\x80\x99 will continue to make fans groove in the 2019 Indian Premier League.


