b'MUMBAI: Barely 24 hours to go before India line-up their playing eleven for the first of the three One-day Internationals against Australia at Sydney, captain Virat Kohli and coach Ravi Shastri are clueless if they can pick all-rounder Hardik Pandya and batsman KL Rahul in the team.



