b'NEW DELHI: The government is readying steps to reward top-performing employees of public sector banks (PSBs), apart from a board-driven appraisal of the top management and governance reforms, while identifying lenders such as Indian Overseas Bank and Punjab & Sind Bank for focus on niche banking, a top government official said.


