b'BENGALURU: Banks are trying to make your dreams come true. Many have over the past year created new kinds of accounts that help you see the floating islands of lake Titicaca, or have a destination wedding at Jagmandir Island Palace, or get your LKG toddler into a good school. It\xe2\x80\x99s a strategy that insurance companies and mutual funds have employed before.

