Kotak Mahindra Bank will soon offer a Holiday RD for those bitten by wanderlust. Customers can deposit a fixed monthly instalment for 12 months. On maturity, the customer will receive a top-up from the travel partner such that the interest earned and the top-up is equal to one additional instalment. "We are currently in discussions with a travel partner to launch this product,\xe2\x80\x9d said a spokesperson of the bank.


