b'Chennai: With its successful resolution applicant (bidder) Liberty House failing to make the necessary payments, debt ridden Amtek Auto is now in a limbo. According to legal experts, currently neither the former promoters and board of Amtek Auto, nor the resolution professional (RP) nor the now-discarded bidder Liberty House are in charge and there\xe2\x80\x99s a \xe2\x80\x9cvacuum\xe2\x80\x9d in the company which is \xe2\x80\x9cwithout precedence\xe2\x80\x9d.

