b'BENGALURU: Flipkart co-founder Sachin Bansal has invested Rs 150 crore in Ola. Over the past two years, Bansal and Ola co-founder Bhavish Aggarwal had become close, with the two having led the fight against the influence of foreign capital in the domestic startup ecosystem.


