b'NEW DELHI: Get set for an onslaught of SUVs in 2019 as the fattest line-up of off-roaders gets ready to hit Indian roads. From entry-level offerings like Mahindra XUV3OO and Hyundai QXI to power-packed ultra-luxury wheels from Audi and BMW, an unprecedented line-up of nearly 20 new SUVs is waiting in the wings, including all-clean, modern electric ones such as Hyundai\xe2\x80\x99s Kona, Audi\xe2\x80\x99s e-tron and Jaguar\xe2\x80\x99s I-PACE.


