b'BENGALURU: TCS CEO Rajesh Gopinathan, in a letter to employees, said the company should be proud of the strong momentum it has generated and its return to a double-digit growth trajectory.


"We have succeeded in winning large deals, expanded into multi-stakeholder business areas and our digital is now 30% of our total revenue," he wrote after TCS announced a 12.1% revenue growth in the third quarter on a constant currency basis.


