 On Tuesday, Javadekar had said the 10% EWS quota will be implemented in the academic year 2019-20 itself in 40,000 colleges and 900 universities, without impacting the existing quotas for SCs,STs and OBCs and general seats . 

 "While the University Grants Commission (UGC) will issue an official memorandum for implementation of the decision to institutions under its jurisdiction, the All India Council of Technical Education (AICTE) will issue circulars for the technical institutions affiliated to it," said an official . 

