b'NEW DELHI: Kalamsat, the world\xe2\x80\x99s smallest satellite built by a student start-up, will be the first satellite that will be \xe2\x80\x9cpowered\xe2\x80\x9d by the last stage of new variant of PSLV rocket in space to perform experiments soon after its launch from Sriharikota on January 24.


