The agency expects states' aggregate capex/GDP to come in marginally lower at 3% in FY20 from the budget estimate of 3.07% for FY19. \xe2\x80\x9cThis capex/GDP is expected to come in below 3% for Tamil Nadu, Haryana, Bengal and Kerala in FY20,\xe2\x80\x9d it said.

