b'BENGALURU: Private equity giant Blackstone Group, also one of the world's most influential real estate investors, is in talks to acquire Coffee Day founder V G Siddhartha's 4.4-million-sqft tenanted office park in a deal estimated at about Rs 2,200 crore, people directly aware of the matter said. 


