TOI on Monday reported that Siddhartha was in advanced discussions with L&T and private equity investor KKR among others, to divest his holding. The four founders \xe2\x80\x94 Krishnakumar Natarajan, Subroto Bagchi, N S Parthasarathy and Rostow Ravanan \xe2\x80\x94 are opposed to a deal with L&T, or any deal, which would force them to cede control of the 19-year-old Mindtree.

