At the M Chinnaswamy stadium on Friday, the second day of the Ranji Trophy semifinal saw the momentum swing from end to end. Karnataka found their hero in pacer of the season, Ronit More (5/54). The 26-year-old claimed his fourth five-wicket haul of the season as Karnataka pace bowlers staged a remarkable comeback to restrict Saurashtra to 227 for seven in 66.3 overs at stumps. Jaydev Unadkat\xe2\x80\x99s men trail the hosts by 48 runs.

